abstract: >-
  A prototype that checks claims made by an AI support bot against policy, account records,
  action logs and tool results. Model extraction plus deterministic verification, a frozen
  pass rule, a blind holdout, two-pass consistency checks and byte-for-byte replay.
  Phase 0 (Run 5) is recorded as failed.
